+.. change::
+    :tags: bug, postgresql
+    :tickets: 4325
+
+    Fixed bug in PostgreSQL dialect where compiler keyword arguments such as
+    ``literal_binds=True`` were not being propagated to a DISTINCT ON
+    expression.
